---
const services=[
 {title:"Care at home",text:"Friendly, dependable support in the comfort and familiarity of home, shaped around the individual and their daily routine."},
 {title:"Companionship",text:"Time, conversation and genuine company — helping people stay connected and enjoy the things that matter to them."},
 {title:"Practical support",text:"A helping hand with everyday routines and activities, always with dignity, choice and independence at the centre."}
];
const wellbeing=["Days out & local trips","Social activities & shared experiences","Seasonal events & changing locations","Friendly, supported company"];
---
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/><meta name="theme-color" content="#315c4b"/><title>KC Care & Wellbeing | Care at Home & Wellbeing Days</title><meta name="description" content="KC Care & Wellbeing provides personal care at home, companionship and welcoming wellbeing days for older people."/><link rel="canonical" href="https://kc-care.org/"/>
<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=Newsreader:opsz,wght@6..72,400;6..72,500&display=swap');
:root{--ink:#26352e;--green:#315c4b;--green2:#426f5d;--cream:#fbf8f1;--sage:#e7eee8;--pink:#f1dfd7;--white:#fff;--muted:#68766e;--line:#dfe5df}*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;background:var(--cream);color:var(--ink);font-family:"DM Sans",sans-serif;line-height:1.65}.wrap{width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 42px));margin:auto}a{color:inherit}.nav{height:88px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.logo{font:500 27px "Newsreader",serif;text-decoration:none;color:var(--green)}.logo small{font:400 16px "DM Sans",sans-serif;display:block;letter-spacing:.03em;margin-top:-6px}.links{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:27px}.links a{text-decoration:none;font-size:14px}.button{display:inline-block;background:var(--green);color:#fff!important;text-decoration:none;border-radius:100px;padding:13px 21px;font-weight:600}.outline{background:transparent;color:var(--green)!important;border:1px solid #89a093}.hero{padding:55px 0 95px}.heroGrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.12fr .88fr;gap:65px;align-items:center}.eyebrow{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.17em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;color:var(--green2)}h1,h2,h3{font-family:"Newsreader",serif;font-weight:400}h1{font-size:clamp(52px,6.2vw,82px);line-height:.99;letter-spacing:-.035em;margin:17px 0 24px;max-width:760px}.lead{font-size:19px;color:var(--muted);max-width:660px}.actions{display:flex;gap:11px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:31px}.heroArt{height:540px;border-radius:48% 48% 24px 24px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#dce9df,#f1dcd3);position:relative;overflow:hidden}.sun{width:210px;height:210px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff8e8;position:absolute;right:46px;top:62px;opacity:.9}.leaf{position:absolute;border:2px solid rgba(49,92,75,.25);width:150px;height:250px;border-radius:100% 0 100% 0;transform:rotate(22deg);left:70px;top:125px}.heroNote{position:absolute;bottom:28px;left:28px;right:28px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.86);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-radius:19px;padding:22px 25px}.heroNote strong{display:block;font:400 26px "Newsreader",serif}.heroNote span{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}section{padding:90px 0}.sectionTitle{max-width:730px;margin-bottom:42px}.sectionTitle h2{font-size:48px;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:10px 0 13px}.sectionTitle p{color:var(--muted);font-size:17px}.soft{background:var(--sage)}.services{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:17px}.service{background:rgba(255,255,255,.82);border-radius:24px;padding:30px;min-height:245px}.service i{font-style:normal;font-size:12px;color:var(--green);font-weight:600}.service h3{font-size:29px;margin:30px 0 9px}.service p{color:var(--muted);font-size:15px}.wellGrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;gap:70px;align-items:center}.wellArt{height:460px;border-radius:28px;background:var(--pink);display:grid;place-items:center;padding:50px;text-align:center}.wellArt p{font:400 42px/1.05 "Newsreader",serif;margin:0}.wellList{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-top:27px}.wellItem{background:white;border:1px solid #eee9e1;border-radius:15px;padding:16px;font-size:14px}.statement{background:var(--green);border-radius:30px;color:white;padding:62px;text-align:center}.statement h2{font-size:46px;line-height:1.08;max-width:820px;margin:12px auto 16px}.statement p{max-width:690px;margin:auto;color:#dce7e1}.contactGrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:60px}.contactCard{background:white;border-radius:25px;padding:35px;border:1px solid var(--line)}.contactCard h3{font-size:30px;margin:0 0 10px}.contactCard p{color:var(--muted)}.notice{font-size:13px;background:#f5f2eb;border-radius:12px;padding:13px;margin-top:20px;color:var(--muted)}footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:34px 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}.foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}@media(max-width:800px){.links a:not(.button){display:none}.hero{padding-top:25px}.heroGrid,.wellGrid,.contactGrid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.heroArt{height:380px}.services{grid-template-columns:1fr}.wellList{grid-template-columns:1fr}section{padding:65px 0}.sectionTitle h2{font-size:39px}.statement{padding:42px 24px}.statement h2{font-size:36px}.foot{flex-direction:column}.wrap{width:min(100% - 30px,1160px)}}
</style></head><body>
<header><div class="wrap nav"><a class="logo" href="/">KC Care<small>& Wellbeing</small></a><nav class="links"><a href="#care">Care at home</a><a href="#wellbeing">Wellbeing days</a><a href="#about">Our approach</a><a class="button" href="#contact">Talk to us</a></nav></div></header>
<main><div class="hero"><div class="wrap heroGrid"><div><div class="eyebrow">Care • companionship • wellbeing</div><h1>Helping people live well, every day.</h1><p class="lead">Personal, friendly support at home alongside welcoming wellbeing days that create opportunities to get out, connect with others and enjoy life.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="#contact">Talk to us about care</a><a class="button outline" href="#wellbeing">Discover wellbeing days</a></div></div><div class="heroArt" aria-hidden="true"><div class="sun"></div><div class="leaf"></div><div class="heroNote"><strong>Care that feels personal.</strong><span>Kindness, dignity, independence and meaningful connection.</span></div></div></div></div>
<section id="care" class="soft"><div class="wrap"><div class="sectionTitle"><div class="eyebrow">Care at home</div><h2>Support shaped around the person.</h2><p>Everyone is different. Our approach starts with the individual — their routines, preferences, independence and the things that make a good day for them.</p></div><div class="services">{services.map((s,i)=><article class="service"><i>0{i+1}</i><h3>{s.title}</h3><p>{s.text}</p></article>)}</div></div></section>
<section id="wellbeing"><div class="wrap wellGrid"><div class="wellArt"><p>More connection.<br/>More experiences.<br/>More good days.</p></div><div><div class="eyebrow">KC Wellbeing Days</div><div class="sectionTitle"><h2>Something to look forward to.</h2><p>Wellbeing is about more than care. Our wellbeing days give people opportunities to socialise, enjoy activities and experiences, and spend time in supportive company.</p></div><div class="wellList">{wellbeing.map(x=><div class="wellItem">✓ &nbsp;{x}</div>)}</div></div></div></section>
<section id="about" class="soft"><div class="wrap"><div class="statement"><div class="eyebrow" style="color:#dbe8e0">Our approach</div><h2>Care should help people keep living their life.</h2><p>We want the people we support to feel known, respected and valued. That means listening, building trust and providing support in a way that protects choice and independence.</p></div></div></section>
<section id="contact"><div class="wrap contactGrid"><div><div class="eyebrow">Get in touch</div><div class="sectionTitle"><h2>Looking for care, companionship or a wellbeing day?</h2><p>We can have an informal conversation about what you or your family member needs and whether KC Care & Wellbeing may be able to help.</p></div></div><aside class="contactCard"><h3>Talk to KC Care</h3><p><strong>Care enquiries</strong><br/>Care at home • Companionship • Wellbeing days</p><p>Contact details and service-area information will appear here once confirmed.</p><div class="notice">We won't publish unconfirmed registration, regulatory or contact information.</div></aside></div></section></main>
<footer><div class="wrap foot"><span>© 2026 KC Care & Wellbeing</span><span>Care • Companionship • Wellbeing</span></div></footer></body></html>